  "releaseNotes": "- docs: update documentations v2 to v3\n- update gitignore and nuget yml\n- remove generate_charts.py\n- refactor(efcore): rename project to EntityFrameworkCore and update references\n- refactor(adapters): restructure AgGrid and Kendo into dedicated adapter projects\n- feat(parsers): add dedicated JQL and MiniOData parser projects\n- test: refresh parser, security, stress, and validation test coverage\n- feat(extensions): update Dapper and EF Core query extensions\n- refactor(core): update parser interfaces and project references\n- refactor: remove MiniOData project and clean up related tests\n- test: update parser and security tests for JQL extraction and filtered includes\n- refactor(parser): extract JQL parser into dedicated project and simplify QueryOptionsParser",
